   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "This is the alignment problem",
     "start": 38.218,
     "end": 40.691
    },
    {
     "text": "Not a monster, just a mirror of our choice",
     "start": 40.691,
     "end": 42.766
    },
    {
     "text": "This is the alignment problem",
     "start": 42.766,
     "end": 45.08
    },
    {
     "text": "And it's waiting for your voice",
     "start": 45.08,
     "end": 47.394
    },
    {
     "text": "Who decides what good should look like?",
     "start": 47.394,
     "end": 49.548
    },
    {
     "text": "All of us, so set the bar up high",
     "start": 49.548,
     "end": 51.622
    },
    {
     "text": "This is the alignment problem",
     "start": 51.622,
     "end": 54.096
    },
    {
     "text": "Let's solve it, you and I",
     "start": 54.096,
     "end": 64.069
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "m_verse2",
   "chapter": "Verse 2",
   "variant": 1,
   "start": 64.069,
   "dur": 18.112,
   "cues": [
    0.0,
    4.548,
    8.936,
    13.963
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "A pressure in your chest at night, it tells you: get it checked",
     "start": 64.069,
     "end": 68.617
    },
    {
     "text": "Your secrets stay your secrets, every name kept with respect",
     "start": 68.617,
     "end": 73.005
    },
    {
     "text": "If someone plans to hurt someone, where should the line be drawn?",
     "start": 73.005,
     "end": 78.032
    },
    {
     "text": "Hard questions need a thousand hearts, not one voice on its own",
     "start": 78.032,
     "end": 82.181
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "m_pre",
   "chapter": "Pre-Chorus",
   "variant": 2,
   "start": 82.181,
   "dur": 9.415,
   "cues": [
    0.0,
    4.149
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Should it please you, or its makers, or the whole human race?",
     "start": 82.181,
     "end": 86.33
    },
    {
     "text": "Agree with every word you say, or tell the truth with grace?",
     "start": 86.33,
     "end": 91.596
    }
   ]
  },
