  {
   "id": "m_bridge",
   "chapter": "Bridge",
   "variant": 1,
   "start": 109.628,
   "dur": 19.228,
   "cues": [
    0.0,
    3.75,
    7.899,
    12.526
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Train a judge to score the answers, that's R-L-H-F",
     "start": 109.628,
     "end": 113.378
    },
    {
     "text": "Or learn straight from the pairs we pick, and D-P-O does the rest",
     "start": 113.378,
     "end": 117.527
    },
    {
     "text": "But if it only learns to please us, it will flatter, not be true",
     "start": 117.527,
     "end": 122.154
    },
    {
     "text": "So we test it in every language, and we ask for something new",
     "start": 122.154,
     "end": 128.856
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "m_verse3",
   "chapter": "Verse 3",
   "variant": 1,
   "start": 128.856,
